---
description: Enforce inward-only imports between Clean Architecture packages
globs: packages/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Layer imports

```ts
// ❌ BAD — domain must not know about use cases or databases
import { SendMessage } from "@clean-chat/use-cases";
import { Postgres } from "@clean-chat/infrastructure";

// ✅ GOOD — use case depends on domain + ports it owns
import type { Channel } from "@clean-chat/domain";
```

- `@clean-chat/domain` — no workspace package imports
- `@clean-chat/use-cases` — `@clean-chat/domain` only
- `@clean-chat/application` — domain + use-cases
- `@clean-chat/infrastructure` — any inner package; implement ports here
